  "label": "Gender Presentation Mockery",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype of mocking or ridiculing individuals for their gender presentation, particularly those who express themselves in ways that deviate from traditional norms (e.g., wearing bright colors, applying makeup, using accessories). This mockery is used to generate humor by contrasting the person's appearance with the serious context of being on the run from the law.",
